It is a Go port of Campfire and is derived from the work of 37signals, LLC:

  - Campfire (Rails) and its Rust port, once-campfire-rust, which is pinned
    as the submodule in reference/. Behavior, the SQLite schema, storage
    layout, cookies, test vectors, and the frontend are taken from it.
    https://github.com/basecamp/once-campfire-rust
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 37signals, LLC.

  - The Campfire frontend that the binary embeds from the reference vendor
    tree (Turbo, Stimulus, Action Cable, Action Text/Trix, Lexxy, Active
    Storage, and related JavaScript, CSS, and images), each under its own
    license in reference/crates/assets/vendor/. These files are generated
    into assets/generated/ at build time and are not stored in this
    repository.

